Package: devjam-cpu-powercap
Version: 1.5-4
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Bob Rosbag <debian@bobrosbag.nl>
Description: Read access to Intel RAPL energy counters
 udev rule that makes the Intel RAPL powercap energy_uj attributes
 readable for the monitoring group, so CPU power use can be shown without
 root, for example by devjam-conky-system-monitor.
